# REQUIRES: python-api
# The derivative of the energy in the tunable parameters
# (D230, docs/python-gradient.md) on the CPU, in double and
# mixed precision: what is refused; constants of a pair term and parameters
# of a term over tuples on the dipeptide in water against NumPy and against
# central differences of the energy that the derivative is of; the steps of
# a run that asks for it against those of one that does not, to the bit; and
# a constant of a pair term under a plain cutoff with the correction for
# the dispersion, the shifted potential with its tail and the estimate of
# its shift (D209, D210), against NumPy and closed forms.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide refusals | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REFUSED
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide terms CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TERMS -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide terms CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TERMS -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide tails CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TAILS -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide tails CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TAILS -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# REFUSED: refusals: the plan, the shapes, and a tunable that the energy does not read
# REFUSED: refusals: 5 refusals
# REFUSED: refusals passed
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide lj CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LJ -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide lj CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LJ -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide charges CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CHARGES -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide charges CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CHARGES -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide dynamics CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DYNAMICS -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide dynamics CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DYNAMICS -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: the term over tuples against NumPy
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: against central differences of the energy
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: the energy less the reported one
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: 12 steps through the derivative equal those without it to the bit: True
# TERMS: terms passed
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: dU/dc
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: against central differences of the energy
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: without the correction
# TAILS: tails passed
# LJ: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide, per-type and pair sigma and epsilon against central differences of the energy
# LJ: [[MODE]]: propane and water, per-type and pair sigma and epsilon with a pair set apart
# LJ: [[MODE]]: propane and water against central differences of the energy
# LJ: lj passed
# CHARGES: [[MODE]]: the charges under a Coulomb cutoff, 25 entries for 1168 particles, against NumPy
# CHARGES: [[MODE]]: against central differences of the energy
# CHARGES: charges passed
# DYNAMICS: [[MODE]]: leapfrog under a barostat, 200 steps
# DYNAMICS-SAME: sigma and epsilon by pairs against central differences of the energy
# DYNAMICS: dynamics passed
